      "sourceTextSha256": "ccdf2a2381f81c911e5e788f3e79438b2a34ad6fd9aa8a8a379d92e6bad6244b",
      "text": "Enjoy your time in Bocas del Toro over the next three days, with a flexible combination of relaxation, independent exploration and optional activities.\n\nDuring your stay, an optional boat excursion can be arranged on the day with the most favourable weather and sea conditions. Depending on the selected route and the location of your hotel, the experience may include dolphin watching, snorkelling in the clear waters of Cayo Coral, and time on the beaches of Zapatilla Cay, with opportunities to spot sloths and starfish along the way.\n\nThe remaining time is free to enjoy the archipelago at your own pace, relax at the hotel or discover the local surroundings.",
