      "sourceTextSha256": "65bc45266008b0b07abbf0e745459c38c6f7c306213b93401c3079ce63a0d525",
      "text": "The remaining time is free to enjoy the archipelago at your own pace, relax at the hotel or discover the local surroundings.\n\nOn Day 10, make the most of your final hours in Bocas del Toro before travelling to the airport for your evening flight back to Panama City. Upon arrival, transfer to your hotel for your final overnight stay in Panama.",
